  "info": {
    "title": "How this program came about",
    "intro": "HUUSanova was created at the Institute of Civil Engineering at HAW Kiel as part of the “Building Simulation” module. The code was written with AI assistance (Claude Code by Anthropic, current model: Claude Opus 5). This page documents how much input was required and how much code resulted – as teaching material on how effort and outcome relate when programming with AI.",
